  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **Second number = (First number × 4) + 2**\n\n**(21: 86)**\n\n→ 86 = (21 × 4) + 2\n\n→ 86 = 84 + 2\n\n**(33: 134)**\n\n→ 134 = (33 × 4) + 2\n\n→ 134 = 132 + 2\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**(25: ?)**\n\n→ ? = (25 × 4) + 2\n\n→ ? = 100 + 2 = 102\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"102\"**.",
